G1 -- `availability` must now read EXACTLY +0.0000 at every position
==============================================================================
  It is a within-position CONSTANT, so it multiplies each position by one positive
  scalar and provably cannot reorder anyone inside a position.
    board mean +0.812672   2020:+0.0000  2021:+0.4351  2022:+0.3185  2024:+3.0489  2025:+0.2608
